  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Solving for Equation of Plane, we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now applying relation to find Image of point about a Plane, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
